  🧪 RECOMMENDED TESTING APPROACH

  Phase 1: Automated Scanning (OWASP ZAP)

  # Download OWASP ZAP from SourceForge or official site
  # Test your live app at: https://trybassline.netlify.app

  Test Categories:
  ✅ XSS Protection (verify no token exposure)
  ✅ CSRF Protection (HTTP-only cookies)
  ✅ Session Management (secure cookie flags)
  ✅ Authentication Flow (PKCE compliance)
  ✅ Input Validation
  ✅ HTTPS enforcement

  Phase 2: OAuth Specific Testing (Burp Suite)

  OAuth Flow Tests:
  ✅ PKCE code verifier validation
  ✅ State parameter verification
  ✅ Token storage location (server-side only)
  ✅ Session cookie security flags
  ✅ Authorization code exchange
  ✅ Scope limitation verification

  Phase 3: Network Security (OpenVAS)

  Infrastructure Tests:
  ✅ TLS/SSL configuration
  ✅ Header security (HSTS, CSP)
  ✅ Server configuration
  ✅ Port scanning and service detection

  📋 VERIFICATION CHECKLIST

  These tools will prove what our security policy states:

  - OWASP ZAP scan shows no XSS vulnerabilities (proves no token exposure)
  - Cookie analysis confirms HTTP-only, Secure, SameSite=Strict flags
  - OAuth flow test validates PKCE implementation
  - Network scan confirms TLS 1.3 and secure headers
  - Session testing proves no localStorage token storage
  - Permission audit confirms minimal Spotify scope requests

